Error [E0112]: `to_bits` needs Float or F32, not String (text)
  --> tests/ui/core_math_value_type_mismatch.jet:10:18
    |
 10 |     math.to_bits("one")
    |                  ^^^^^
 Why: Only floating-point values have this bit representation
